      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we move these to snapshot/vendor_snapshot.go, and the others to snapshot/recovery_snapshot.go?\n\nOr should all snapshots must include all SnapshotModuleInterface?\nIf so, when we add more snapshots, that requires updating all existing snapshots.",
